アリーナなのに
Even though it's an arena,

124
00:15:40,411 --> 00:15:43,311
アリーナみたいじゃない、そんな気がするし
it doesn't feel like an arena... or at least it feels that way.

125
00:15:44,911 --> 00:15:46,661
ザイン君も夢？
Is Zain-kun a dream too?

126
00:15:46,861 --> 00:15:48,211
何が正しいの？
What is right?

127
00:15:49,011 --> 00:15:50,311
アイドルって何？
What is an idol?

128
00:15:50,861 --> 00:15:53,211
笑うことがアイドルじゃないの？
Isn't an idol supposed to smile?

129
00:15:54,411 --> 00:16:00,411
アイドルって笑わせてで、笑ってもらって笑顔を振りまいてさ……
Idols make you laugh, make you smile, shower you with smiles...

130
00:16:01,961 --> 00:16:04,011
そうじゃないんだ、いまは
That's not how it is right now.

131
00:16:06,011 --> 00:16:07,911
もう、そっか
Oh right...

132
00:16:12,811 --> 00:16:14,711
こんな世界、おかしいよ
A world like this is crazy!

133
00:16:18,111 --> 00:16:20,811
全部壊れちゃえばいいのに
Everything should just break apart.

134
00:16:37,296 --> 00:16:38,696
Hello! Hello! Everyone

135
00:16:38,896 --> 00:16:40,596
まもなく On Stage
Coming soon On Stage

136
00:16:40,896 --> 00:16:42,296
Lie Life 自己暗示さ
Lie Life, autosuggestion,

137
00:16:42,396 --> 00:16:43,996
さあ…始めよう。
now... let's begin.

138
00:16:57,843 --> 00:17:00,143
「ようこそParty Night」誰かが語る
"Welcome to Party Night," someone whispers.

139
00:17:00,543 --> 00:17:03,243
連日満員御礼 どうぞご贔屓に
Packed houses every day, please treat us favorably.

140
00:17:03,343 --> 00:17:05,843
「待ってたShow Time」誰かが語る
"Waiting for Show Time," someone whispers,

141
00:17:06,043 --> 00:17:10,443
どうでもいいような 顔を見せてよね
show me a face that looks like it doesn't even matter.

142
00:17:11,043 --> 00:17:13,143
はぁ… 偶像捏造炎上、並べたなら一攫千金？
Ah... Fabricated idols and online controversy—line them up for quick riches?

143
00:17:13,243 --> 00:17:17,243
ふざけちゃいませんか？ 今辿り着いた憧れの世界
Aren't you messing around? The world of longing I've finally reached

144
00:17:17,543 --> 00:17:19,243
ここはまるでペテン師の楽園
is like a paradise for swindlers.

145
