00:34:33,166 --> 00:34:39,146
上手くいかなくって 空回ってばかりで 少し落ち込んじゃう日もあるけれど
When things don't go well and I'm just spinning my wheels, there are days when I feel a bit down, but

299
00:34:44,216 --> 00:34:46,896
見ててね 大丈夫 いつまでも
watch over me, it'll be alright, forever and ever,

