確実に触れる思い出だから
It's a memory I can truly touch.

357
00:38:49,663 --> 00:38:54,363
流れ星に詰め込んだ願い事
Wishes packed into shooting stars,

358
00:38:54,463 --> 00:39:00,363
またここでみんなで逢えますように
Hoping we can meet here again.

359
00:39:06,263 --> 00:39:11,313
繋がっていく夢の途中で
In the middle of a connecting dream,

360
00:39:11,413 --> 00:39:15,113
未来への想いを持って
Holding thoughts for the future,

361
00:39:15,513 --> 00:39:18,263
おやすみ
Good night.

362
00:39:16,013 --> 00:39:23,113
待ち遠しい夢の続きを待ちきれない子供みたいに
Like a child too impatient for the continuation of a long-awaited dream,

363
00:39:23,313 --> 00:39:29,463
降りた幕を背に見晴らした星空
I gazed as star-filled skies rained down.

364
00:39:29,563 --> 00:39:35,863
明日も輝いていてほしい
I hope tomorrow shines just as bright.

365
00:39:36,113 --> 00:39:42,363
消えていく白熱灯
Fading incandescent lights,

366
00:39:42,563 --> 00:39:45,813
眠りいく街並み
A townscape falling asleep.

367
00:39:46,063 --> 00:39:50,063
愛しい終わりのこの目に映して
Reflecting this lovely ending before my eyes,

368
00:39:50,613 --> 00:39:56,063
月明かりの差すこ…
In the attic where moonlight streams in...

369
00:40:02,021 --> 00:40:05,111
夢見る眠りで 幾つもの
